      "settings": {
        "kicker": "",
        "heading": "Meet the owners - Derek and Rochelle Crimin!",
        "body_text": "<p>Derek taught seminary and institute with the Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints for almost 30 years all over Davis County in Utah and taught with EFY and FSY for 15+ years. He is a forever a teacher at heart and loves sharing the gospel of Jesus Christ!</p><p>Rochelle is Derek’s amazingly beautiful wife and they were married in 1996 in the Ogden UT Temple! They have 6 crazy awesome “Crimlets” ranging from two girls (ages 27 and 25) and 4 boys (ages 21, 19, 19 (yes, twins), and 17.  They live in Clinton, UT.  She loves to experiment with recipes and makes amazing food. Her homemade cookies are the stuff of legend!  She has a passion for learning and is constantly picking up new skills to help everyone who knows her to become better.<br/></p>",
