      "settings": {
        "kicker": "",
        "heading": "",
        "body_text": "<p>Derek’s obsession with matching accessories…ties, watches, rings, belts, and of course, SOCKS - led them to B.O.M.Socks, which they have owned since November of 2018 after Derek felt prompted to pursue something beyond the seminary classroom. He often jokes that B.O.M.Socks is what happens when a seminary teacher gets bored with his wardrobe. Underneath the humor is a serious purpose: helping people remember, share, connect to and smile about their faith.</p><p>Their broader message is that God can be found in ordinary life — in scripture, family, business, struggle, humor, creativity, and even a pair of socks. </p>",
